'''Masquerade''' (仮面舞踏会, ''Kamen Butōkai'', '''Masquerade''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Knockback" Effect UP (M): Knockback distance increases by 20%.

